  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "m-004",
      "type": "structured",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-005",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Question 1: The market for private tuition in Hong Kong has grown for ten years."
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "第 1 題：香港私人補習市場在過去十年持續增長。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "m-006",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-007",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "State two factors that may have increased the demand for private tuition, and explain one of them."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "指出可能令私人補習需求增加的兩個因素，並解釋其中一個。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 4,
          "answerSpace": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "m-008",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-009",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Explain, with the aid of a diagram, how the equilibrium price and quantity of tuition change."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "借助圖表，解釋補習的均衡價格和數量如何改變。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 5,
          "answerSpace": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m-010",
      "type": "structured",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-011",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Question 2: A tutoring centre raises its fee by 10% and its revenue falls."
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "第 2 題：一間補習社將收費提高10%，但收益下降。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "m-012",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-013",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "What can be said about the price elasticity of demand for the centre’s lessons? Give a reason."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "就該補習社課堂的需求價格彈性可作何推論？試給出理由。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 3,
          "answerSpace": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "m-014",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-015",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Explain why a fall in total revenue does not always mean a fall in profit."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "解釋為何總收益下降不一定令利潤下降。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 4,
          "answerSpace": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m-016",
      "type": "structured",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-017",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Question 3: The government considers a subsidy for low-income families to buy tuition."
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "第 3 題：政府考慮資助低收入家庭購買補習服務。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "m-018",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-019",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Explain, with the aid of a diagram, the effect of the subsidy on the market for tuition."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "借助圖表，解釋資助對補習市場的影響。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 5,
          "answerSpace": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "m-020",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-021",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Who bears more of the benefit of the subsidy, the buyers or the sellers? Explain your answer."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "買家和賣家，誰得益較多？解釋你的答案。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 4,
          "answerSpace": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "m-022",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-023",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Give one reason why the subsidy may be criticised on the ground of efficiency."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "就效率而言，給出該資助可能受到批評的一個理由。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 3,
          "answerSpace": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m-024",
      "type": "structured",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-025",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Question 4: Rents of tutoring centres in Mong Kok rise sharply."
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "第 4 題：旺角補習社的租金大幅上升。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "m-026",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-027",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "State the effect of the rise in rent on the supply of tuition in the short run."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "指出租金上升在短期內對補習供應的影響。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 2,
          "answerSpace": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "m-028",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-029",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Explain why the effect may differ in the long run."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "解釋為何長期的影響可能不同。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 3,
          "answerSpace": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m-030",
      "type": "structured",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-031",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Question 5: A new online platform lowers the cost of tuition."
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "第 5 題：一個新的網上平台令補習成本下降。"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": "m-032",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-033",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Explain the effect on the market for face-to-face tuition."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "解釋對面授補習市場的影響。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 3,
          "answerSpace": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "m-034",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "id": "m-035",
              "text": {
                "en": [
                  {
                    "text": "Name one possible external cost of the growth of tuition and explain it."
                  }
                ],
                "zh": [
                  {
                    "text": "指出補習增長可能帶來的一項外部成本並解釋。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "marks": 3,
          "answerSpace": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m-036",
      "type": "mcq",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-037",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Which of the following is a likely effect of a subsidy to buyers of tuition?"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "以下哪項最可能是對補習買家提供資助的影響？"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "m-038",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The equilibrium price rises"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "均衡價格上升"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-039",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The equilibrium price falls"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "均衡價格下降"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-040",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The supply curve shifts left"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "供應曲線左移"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-041",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The demand curve shifts left"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "需求曲線左移"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "answerIndex": 0
    }
  ],
